<section class="content-card">

<h1>CGPA Calculator</h1>

<p>
Use this free CGPA Calculator to calculate your cumulative grade
point average from your semester GPA and credit hours. Add your
semesters and get your CGPA instantly.
</p>

<div class="calc-box" id="semesters">

<div class="semester">

<div class="semester-title">Semester 1</div>

