CGPA stands for Cumulative Grade Point Average. It represents
your overall academic performance across multiple semesters.
</p>

<p>
<strong>How is CGPA calculated?</strong><br>
CGPA is calculated by dividing total quality points by total
credit hours.
</p>

<p>
<strong>Can I calculate CGPA for multiple semesters?</strong><br>
Yes. Use the Add Semester button to include additional semesters.
</p>

<p>
